your pc will have a life after this




Jarvis Startup is a no-login app for Windows and Mac.
On login, it plays your welcome video fullscreen, closes it by itself, 
then plays your music in the background on loop until you stop it. Built with Python and VLC.

For the repo top, use this longer one:

Jarvis Startup turns your PC login into a Jarvis-style boot-up.
Pick your own welcome video and music folder, press Install to Startup, 
and every login plays the video, closes it automatically,
and keeps your music running minimized in the background.
No account, no cloud, all settings saved locally.
